OL,3,GNEWSA'A nightmare I'd like to forget' -
OL,4,Apatients of failing health board say   
OL,5,Ait's beyond redemption                 
OL,7,FA woman who spent 48 hours desperately 
OL,8,Funwell in an emergency department      
OL,9,Fcorridor says bosses at Wales' biggest 
OL,10,Fhealth board have lost interest in     
OL,11,Fpatients.                              
OL,13,FJo Hughes, 72, who is in remission from
OL,14,Fcancer, spent two days in a hospital   
OL,15,Fchair with Covid, pneumonia and a      
OL,16,Fkidney infection.                      
OL,18,FAnother patient, who has been treated  
OL,19,Fat the same hospital for 30 years, said
OL,20,Fthe north Wales health board Betsi     
OL,21,FCadwaladr is "completely leaderless"   
OL,22,Fand has declined "beyond redemption".  
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
